{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Toroa: Skycall",
    "steam_appid": 2003490,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003490/extras/b95fe77499e556d45dcbd35a845021aa.webp?t=1749344927\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soar the skies as Toroa, the mighty albatross! Embark on its epic journey home across the vast ocean in this atmospheric, exploration adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guided by the winds of atua (M\u0101ori God) of the weather, T\u0101whirim\u0101tea, Toroa will travel across boundless seas and skies, meet a cast of creatures across the ocean and unravel stories of the past before reuniting with their family. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003490/extras/9820f671895f48b877e65fd7994625ca.webp?t=1749344927\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Toroa have the largest wingspan in the world! Glide on dynamic wind currents and explore stylised landscapes, from calm seas to high above verdant islands and into dream-like cloudscapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chat with and befriend a colourful cast of creatures from the South Pacific including dolphins, whales, penguins and more! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take your time to search for peaceful encounters within each level, there are no enemies, violence or high stakes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trade kelp with creatures to gather friends into a flock who will follow you all the way to the end of your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect a smorgasbord of tasty looking trash strewn about the ocean (NOT FOR CONSUMPTION) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A heartfelt story grounded in te ao M\u0101ori (the M\u0101ori world) about family, past, present and future. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Listen to a lush soundtrack showcasing the beauty of taonga p\u016boro (M\u0101ori musical instruments) and experience the beauty of the M\u0101ori language with fully text translated dialogues and story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003490/extras/49c3f03a9d4ba3519bd0cc4916aac745.poster.avif?t=1749344927\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003490/extras/49c3f03a9d4ba3519bd0cc4916aac745.webm?t=1749344927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003490/extras/49c3f03a9d4ba3519bd0cc4916aac745.mp4?t=1749344927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003490/extras/b95fe77499e556d45dcbd35a845021aa.webp?t=1749344927\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soar the skies as Toroa, the mighty albatross! Embark on its epic journey home across the vast ocean in this atmospheric, exploration adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guided by the winds of atua (M\u0101ori God) of the weather, T\u0101whirim\u0101tea, Toroa will travel across boundless seas and skies, meet a cast of creatures across the ocean and unravel stories of the past before reuniting with their family. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003490/extras/9820f671895f48b877e65fd7994625ca.webp?t=1749344927\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Toroa have the largest wingspan in the world! Glide on dynamic wind currents and explore stylised landscapes, from calm seas to high above verdant islands and into dream-like cloudscapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chat with and befriend a colourful cast of creatures from the South Pacific including dolphins, whales, penguins and more! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take your time to search for peaceful encounters within each level, there are no enemies, violence or high stakes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trade kelp with creatures to gather friends into a flock who will follow you all the way to the end of your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect a smorgasbord of tasty looking trash strewn about the ocean (NOT FOR CONSUMPTION) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A heartfelt story grounded in te ao M\u0101ori (the M\u0101ori world) about family, past, present and future. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Listen to a lush soundtrack showcasing the beauty of taonga p\u016boro (M\u0101ori musical instruments) and experience the beauty of the M\u0101ori language with fully text translated dialogues and story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003490/extras/49c3f03a9d4ba3519bd0cc4916aac745.poster.avif?t=1749344927\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003490/extras/49c3f03a9d4ba3519bd0cc4916aac745.webm?t=1749344927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003490/extras/49c3f03a9d4ba3519bd0cc4916aac745.mp4?t=1749344927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "short_description": "Glide as an albatross embarking on its epic journey back home to land in this relaxing flight adventure set across the vast Pacific Ocean. Meet creatures of the sea and unravel stories of the past as you fly through dream-like clouds and lush oceanic environments grounded in the M\u0101ori world.",
